{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Vektoris3D 是一款為立體幾何與空間解析幾何而設的 iPad 與 iPhone 應用，適閤中學至大專的數學學習者、數學教師，以及需要處理空間模型的用家。你可在互動 3D 場景中建立點、向量、直線、平面、曲面、立體與量度，並以滑桿調整座標與變數，即時看見相依物件同步更新。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>互動立體幾何視覺化學習</h2>\n<p>Vektoris3D 把數學表示、空間視覺化與建構邏輯連繫起來，不只顯示結果，亦呈現物件之間的關係、公式、量度與相依性。內置相依圖可追溯建構路徑，量度功能涵蓋距離、角度、面積與體積，公式以精確數學記號渲染，並附設範例與課堂場景及 AR 檢視模式。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-672-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-673-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-674-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-675-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-676-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-677-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Vektoris3D</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-28T20:38:58.088728+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":340,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}